...@_theme
direction: right

Fetch: "Fetch\nGather referenced resources" {class: step}
Compose: "Compose\nInterpret state, check health" {class: step}
Plan: "Plan\nDecide what to create or update" {class: step}
Apply: "Apply\nExecute changes against the cluster" {class: step}
Status: "Status\nUpdate conditions and health" {class: step}

Fetch -> Compose -> Plan -> Apply -> Status
